#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.to_parquet.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.to\\_parquet"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:1 of
msgid ""
"Write a LiteFrame to the binary parquet format, each chunk will be "
"written to a Parquet file."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入二进制 parquet 格式，每个块将写入一个 Parquet 文件。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:4 of
msgid "Simplified version for LiteFrame with no index semantics."
msgstr "LiteFrame 的简化版本，没有索引语义。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:6 of
msgid ""
"If path is a string with wildcard e.g. '/to/path/out-*.parquet', "
"`to_parquet` will try to write multiple files, for instance, chunk (0, 0)"
" will write data into '/to/path/out-0.parquet'. If path is a string "
"without wildcard and partition_cols is None, all data will be written "
"into a single file. If path is a string with wildcard or partition_cols "
"is not None, we will treat it as a directory."
msgstr ""
"如果路径是带有通配符的字符串，例如 '/to/path/out-*.parquet'，`to_parquet`"
" 将尝试写入多个文件，例如，块 (0, 0) 将数据写入 '/to/path/out-0.parquet'"
"。如果路径是不带通配符的字符串且 partition_cols 为 None，则所有数据将写入"
"单个文件。如果路径是带有通配符的字符串或 partition_cols 不为 None，我们将"
"将其视为目录。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:14 of
msgid "Parquet library to use. Only 'pyarrow' is currently supported."
msgstr "要使用的 Parquet 库。目前仅支持 'pyarrow'。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:16 of
msgid "Name of the compression to use. Use ``None`` for no compression."
msgstr "要使用的压缩名称。使用 ``None`` 表示无压缩。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:18 of
msgid ""
"Column names by which to partition the dataset. Columns are partitioned "
"in the order they are given. Must be None if path is not a string."
msgstr ""
"用于对数据集进行分区的列名。列按给定顺序进行分区。如果路径不是字符串，则"
"必须为 None。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:22 of
msgid "Extra options that make sense for a particular storage connection."
msgstr "对特定存储连接有意义的额外选项。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:24 of
msgid "Additional arguments passed to the parquet library."
msgstr "传递给 parquet 库的附加参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:26 of
msgid "Returns a stub LiteFrame for execution."
msgstr "返回用于执行的存根 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:31 of
msgid ":py:obj:`read_parquet`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:32 of
msgid "Read a Parquet file into a LiteFrame."
msgstr "将 Parquet 文件读取到 LiteFrame 中。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`to_csv`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.datastore.to_parquet.to_parquet:35 of
msgid "Write a LiteFrame to a CSV file."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 写入 CSV 文件。"

